sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Biz as Business Lead
  participant PM as Project Manager (PM)
  participant Dev as Development Lead
  participant Ops as Operations Lead
  participant Info as Information Management Lead
  participant QA as Quality Lead
  participant Sponsor as Sponsor
  Note over Biz,Sponsor: CR-01 / ISSUE-03 / RISK-04 — fictional case as of 2026-10-14.<br/>SMS is under assessment. The current baseline permits only in-app and email notices.<br/>The routes below are decision rules for the 2026-10-16 meeting, no approval is asserted.
  Biz->>PM: Request SMS in the first release, state purpose, recipients and deadline
  PM->>PM: Register CR-01 and compare requested scope with the current baseline
  alt Request lacks use case, recipient definition or acceptance evidence
    PM-->>Biz: Return for missing evidence, name the owner and resubmission date
    Note over Biz,PM: Returned for clarification, no implementation instruction and no baseline change
  else Request can be assessed
    par Effort, delivery and existing commitments
      PM->>Dev: Assess implementation, regression, dependencies and the resource conflict
      Dev-->>PM: Provisional estimate +8 person-days / +JPY 600,000, alternatives and date impact
    and Personal information and external transmission
      PM->>Info: Assess recipient data, consent, retention, processor terms and release blockers
      Info-->>PM: Required evidence, unresolved conditions and named follow-up owners
    and Operational impact
      PM->>Ops: Assess monitoring, failure handling, service contacts and recovery steps
      Ops-->>PM: Operational constraints and checks required before handover
    and Independent validation
      PM->>QA: Assess test changes and capacity, preserve mandatory acceptance coverage
      QA-->>PM: Regression evidence required, mock UI tests do not prove real API acceptance
    end
    PM->>PM: Compare add now / defer to a later release / reject, record assumptions and uncertainty
    alt Information-management release conditions remain unmet
      Info-->>PM: Block release of the proposed change until specified evidence is accepted
      PM-->>Sponsor: Hold the change, the Sponsor cannot waive the unresolved safety blocker
      PM-->>Biz: Current scope remains, return missing evidence and a review deadline
    else Decision evidence is complete enough for sponsor review
      PM->>Sponsor: Present CR-01 options, +8 person-days / +JPY 600,000, dates and residual risks
      alt Approve with explicit scope, funding and conditions
        Sponsor-->>PM: Authorize only the recorded scope, cost and conditions
        PM->>Info: Confirm blocking conditions have actually been discharged
        alt Conditions or resources are still missing
          PM-->>Biz: Hold implementation, name the missing evidence and reconsideration date
          Note over PM,Sponsor: Conditional approval alone does not activate a changed baseline
        else Conditions and resources are confirmed
          PM->>PM: Version the baseline, record before/after scope, cost, dates, owners and tests
          PM->>Dev: Issue the authorized baseline and implementation instruction
          PM->>Ops: Issue the revised monitoring and handover requirements
          PM-->>Biz: Communicate approved scope, forecast date and acceptance criteria
          Dev->>QA: Submit implementation and traceable test evidence
          loop Until independently verified or escalated for a new decision
            QA->>QA: Retest the change and affected functions against real integration evidence
            alt Verification fails or a blocker reappears
              QA-->>Dev: Return defects with evidence, keep release blocked
              Dev->>QA: Correct defects and resubmit the evidence
            else Verification passes
              QA-->>PM: Record passing independent results against the authorized criteria
            end
          end
          alt Independent verification has passed and blockers are cleared
            QA-->>Biz: Present the independent results for business acceptance
            alt Business accepts against the agreed criteria
              Biz-->>PM: Confirm acceptance with the evidence reference
              PM->>PM: Close CR-01 only with decision, baseline, verification and receipt records
            else Business returns remaining differences
              Biz-->>PM: Return the unaccepted criteria and supporting evidence
              PM->>Dev: Reopen linked work, correct within scope or request a new decision
              Note over Biz,PM: CR-01 remains open, neither a forecast nor a failed acceptance closes it
            end
          else Verification is incomplete or escalation is required
            QA-->>PM: Keep release blocked, identify the evidence gap and remaining defects
            PM->>Sponsor: Escalate scope, resource or date options for a new decision
            Note over PM,Sponsor: CR-01 remains open, escalation is not acceptance or release authority
          end
        end
      else Reject the request
        Sponsor-->>PM: Record the reason and any conditions for reconsideration
        PM-->>Biz: Keep in-app/email scope, explain the decision and available alternative
      else Defer SMS beyond the first release
        Sponsor-->>PM: Record later-release conditions, owner and next review date
        PM-->>Biz: Keep the current baseline, record SMS as a deferred candidate
      else Return for evidence or unresolved resources
        Sponsor-->>PM: Specify missing materials and a reconsideration deadline
        PM-->>Biz: Assessment remains open, no unapproved SMS work may start
      end
      Biz-->>PM: Acknowledge the decision or raise a recorded discrepancy
      PM->>PM: Preserve the decision and communication trail for approval, rejection or deferral
    end
  end
